{{!
    @template tool_vae/selfpos_node

    One node of the self-positioning: the two sentences of every screen, the level name, the record and the label of the
    node, the reason it cannot be positioned on or the form, the word of the structure (or that it wrote nothing), the count
    of the declarations, the lines of the record before, the history of the node (the line that stands, then the earlier
    ones), and the way back to the tree. The parts touch: the template holds on one logical line, each break carried by a
    comment.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\selfpos_node. The template holds no logic. Every
    value is escaped (double braces) except three keys:
    * disclaimerhtml - the two sentences, drawn by the template tool_vae/selfpos_disclaimer
    * formhtml - the form of the node, drawn by the core (moodleform::render()), or empty
    * justificationhtml - the justification of a line, drawn by format_text() with the format the vaeiste chose

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * disclaimerhtml - string, HTML of a template
    * levelname, fichecode, label - string, the level name, the record and the label of the node
    * notpositionable - object or null: text, why the node cannot be positioned on
    * formhtml - string, HTML of the core, or empty
    * regardheading - string, the heading of the word of the structure
    * regardnone - object or null: text, that the structure wrote nothing
    * regardline - object or null: text, the word of the structure
    * declarations - object or null: text, the count of the declarations
    * successor - array of {text}: what the record this one replaces positioned
    * historyheading - string, the heading of the history
    * history - object: none (object: text, or null), lines (array of {heading, levellabel, when, justification}); heading is an
      object (text) or null, justification an object (justificationhtml) or null
    * backurl, back - string, the way back to the tree of the record

    Example context (json):
    {
        "disclaimerhtml": "<p class=\"text-muted small tool-vae-selfpos-disclaimer\">This is not a validation.</p>",
        "levelname": "Competency",
        "fichecode": "RNCP400",
        "label": "Help with daily care",
        "notpositionable": null,
        "formhtml": "",
        "regardheading": "The word of the structure",
        "regardnone": null,
        "regardline": {"text": "The structure wrote: in the course of proof, 4 November 2026"},
        "declarations": {"text": "1 declaration(s), including 0 attested, 0 supporting piece(s)"},
        "successor": [{"text": "On the earlier record RNCP90 (C11): I practise with help, 4 November 2025"}],
        "historyheading": "History",
        "history": {
            "none": null,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "heading": {"text": "Line that stands"}, "levellabel": "I act on my own",
                    "when": "Wednesday, 4 November 2026, 10:12 AM", "justification": {"justificationhtml": "Three weeks."}
                },
                {
                    "heading": {"text": "Earlier lines"}, "levellabel": "I practise with help",
                    "when": "Tuesday, 3 November 2026, 9:00 AM", "justification": null
                }
            ]
        },
        "backurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/selfposition.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP400",
        "back": "Back to the record"
    }
}}
<section class="tool-vae-selfpos">{{{disclaimerhtml}}}{{!
}}<p><span class="small text-muted me-2">{{levelname}}</span><strong>{{fichecode}}</strong> - {{label}}</p>{{!
}}{{#notpositionable}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/notpositionable}}{{{formhtml}}}{{!
}}<h3 class="h5">{{regardheading}}</h3>{{!
}}{{#regardnone}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/regardnone}}{{#regardline}}<p>{{text}}</p>{{/regardline}}{{!
}}{{#declarations}}<p class="small">{{text}}</p>{{/declarations}}{{!
}}{{#successor}}<p class="small text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/successor}}{{!
}}<h3 class="h5">{{historyheading}}</h3>{{!
}}{{#history}}{{#none}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/none}}{{!
}}{{^none}}<div class="tool-vae-history">{{#lines}}{{#heading}}<h4 class="h6">{{text}}</h4>{{/heading}}{{!
}}<div class="ms-3 mb-2"><div class="small"><strong>{{levellabel}}</strong> {{when}}</div>{{!
}}{{#justification}}<div>{{{justificationhtml}}}</div>{{/justification}}</div>{{/lines}}</div>{{/none}}{{/history}}{{!
}}<p><a href="{{backurl}}">{{back}}</a></p></section>
